  (text "+5V = diode-OR of the edge +5V (B4) and USB VBUS. +3V3 from U30. VSRAM = the higher of +3V3 and the coin cell (U32)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 285 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f844a4a1-a1ea-44d5-b8d6-e328d32b5a65"))
